    "sibling of fixture 7 in docs/EVALUATION.md \u00a72, added by the ADR 0009 amendment",
    "volatile-external-dep is the unprobed arm; this is the probed arm. Their expected blocks are deliberately identical -- that identity IS the assertion. Wave 2 shipped the volatile rule inside arbitration's Err(no_probe) arm, where these two would have disagreed: unprobed likely-valid, probed unknown, on the strength of probe registration alone.",
